    rcap:evidencePosition "trailing:4" ;
    rcap:evidenceSection "7.8.7" ;
    rcap:evidenceText "With respect to reporting of Platform Conclusions and adaptations of the domain the following actions are possible: Factors that should be taken into account by the DSMB and the ITSC include the results of the primary analysis, analysis of clinically relevant secondary end-points, the possibility of treatment-by-treatment interactions, the relative burden and cost of the two interventions, the clinical interpretation of the adequacy of the delta, the possibility that ongoing randomization with a smaller delta might also allow a Statistical Trigger for superiority (with a small effect size) and the ordinal position of the equivalent pair within the domain." ;
    rcap:occurrenceKind "allocation_rar" .

